{title: On My Heart Imprint Thine Image}
{artist: Thomas Hansen Kingo · tr. Peer Olsen Strømme}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 100}

Verse 1
On my heart imprint Thine image, Blessed Jesus, King of Grace
That life's riches, cares, and pleasures, Have no pow'r to Thee efface;
This the superscription be: Jesus crucified for me,
Is my life, my hope's foundation, And my glory and salvation.
